      "annotations": [
        "The agent presents the PS-issued auth token in Signature-Key using sig=jwt, in place of the person token it used before.",
        "The resource verifies typ=aa-auth+jwt, iss=the PS named by ps, aud=this resource, and cnf.jwk against the key that signed the request.",
        "It verifies sub is present and that (iss, sub) matches the record it established when it verified the person token.",
        "The auth token carries no agent identifier and no delegation chain. cnf binds it to one key; the resource enforces on sub and scope."
      ],
